    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3-Bedroom Semi-Detached House\nLocated in the attractive, convenient and well-maintained Springvale estate, this house is in excellent condition and ready for immediate occupation. Tubbercurry Golf Course is located to the rear of the property, ensuring that no building will ever take place there. An attractive communal green area to the front is ideal for children to play and socialise.\n\nThe estate is only 1 km from Tubbercurry town centre and within walking and cycling distance of all local sports facilities, schools, shops and amenities. It is 30 minutes from Sligo town, 35 minutes from Ballina, 40 minutes from Castlebar and 15 minutes from Ireland West Airport Knock.\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance hall 1.7 m x 1.5 m\nSitting room 3.4 m x 4.7 m\nKitchen 4.2 m x 3.1 m Built-in units and tiled floor\nUtility room 2.5 m x 1.6 m\nWC 1.5 m x 1.6 m\nLanding 2.7 m x 2.2 m Including hot press\nPrimary bedroom 3.8 m x 3.4 m Built-in units\nEn suite 1.8 m x 1.6 m\nBedroom 2 3.5 m x 2.4 m\nBedroom 3 2.3 m x 2.3 m\nFamily bathroom 1.5 m x 2.5 m\n\nFeatures:\n\nMains water\nMains gas\nuPVC windows and doors\nEnd-of-terrace house\nSide-gate access\nEnclosed rear garden\nCobblelock driveway\n\nContact:\n\nTel: 071 91 85050\nEmail: info@reamccarrick.ie\n\n"
      }
    ],
